th="1200" height="1400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=""><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI study · Concept</p><h3>Rectangle hoops & aquamarine</h3><p>Follow the parts of a rounded rectangle hoop composition.</p></a></article><article class="r-study"><a href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/study-gate' | replace: '//', '/' }}"><img src="{{ 'suiji-final2-white-A088-1200.webp' | asset_url }}" data-photo-origin="final2-white" alt="A brushed ring, your way" width="1200" height="1400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=""><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI study · Concept</p><h3>A brushed ring, your way</h3><p>A brushed ring base, shown separately and with an oval charm.</p></a></article><article class="r-study"><a href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/study-triangle' | replace: '//', '/' }}"><img src="{{ 'suiji-final2-white-A114-1200.webp' | asset_url }}" data-photo-origin="final2-white" alt="Circular hoops &amp; charms" width="1200" height="1400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=""><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI study · Concept</p><h3>Circular hoops & charms</h3><p>A circular hoop composition with interchangeable oval charms.</p></a></article></div></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>From a concept to a wearable piece</h2></div><p>Concepts and 3D previews help discuss appearance. Feasibility, engineering, prototypes and production are subsequent steps, arranged after the version, materials and price are confirmed.</p><ol class="r-steps"><li><span>01</span><h3>Explore</h3></li><li><span>02</span><h3>Review the structure</h3></li><li><span>03</span><h3>Agree the version</h3></li><li><span>04</span><h3>Make & check</h3></li></ol></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Prefer to speak to a person?</h2></div><p>You can email us about a different material, a design or a way of wearing a piece. A paid membership is not required for a custom enquiry.</p><a class="r-link" href="mailto:contact@suijijewelry.com">contact@suijijewelry.com<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Custom work</h2></div><aside class="r-custom-sale" data-custom-final-sale><p class="r-custom-sale__label"><strong>Custom work · Final sale</strong></p><p>Personalised designs and agreed changes beyond our standard product options are final sale: they cannot be returned or exchanged for a change of mind.</p><p>Your statutory rights for faulty or non-conforming goods remain unchanged.</p><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/shipping-returns#custom-orders' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Custom-order return terms<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></aside></section></div>
